diagnostics/property-read-only.em:33:5: `size` is a read-only property of Box
  box.size = 3
      ^^^^
It is computed each time it is read. Change what it is computed from instead, or give it a `set` block as a `var` property.
diagnostics/property-read-only.em:34:5: `size` is a read-only property of Box
  box.size += 1
      ^^^^
It is computed each time it is read. Change what it is computed from instead, or give it a `set` block as a `var` property.
